No donation processing fee is charged to the customer.
3.2 Rice Bank
Each participating vendor maintains a separate Rice Bank balance.
The balance represents prepaid servings that have not yet been claimed.
Daily accounting:
Opening balance + New prepaid servings − Redeemed servings = Closing balance.
Prepaid servings are credits, not cooked food held in storage. Rice is prepared normally when requested.
The vendor must honour all outstanding prepaid servings.
3.3 Beneficiary Access
Access is open to everyone.
Priority groups:
* Students.
* Schoolchildren.
* Children from households experiencing financial difficulties.
Other eligible recipients:
* Workers.
* Senior citizens.
* Families.
* Anyone who needs a free serving.
No income verification, identification or public registration is required for ordinary walk-in access.
No beneficiary names or personal details are collected.
