Use actual results to establish the next 30-day Community Goal.
10. Food Safety and Compliance
Rice Circle does not operate its own food preparation facilities.
Each participating vendor remains responsible for its food preparation, handling, permits and sanitation.
Participating businesses must maintain applicable sanitary permits and health certificates for food handlers.
Cooked rice intended to be served hot must be maintained under applicable food safety temperature requirements.
The project should coordinate with the Dumaguete City Health Office where necessary.
